  "title": "Sweet Potato Cupcakes with Toasted Marshmallow Frosting",
  "description": "Spiced sweet potato cupcakes topped with an amazing toasted marshmallow frosting make a delicious Thanksgiving dessert or fall treat!",
  "authors": [
